      "text": "You can put in a home phone work phone, I'm just going to put in a mobile phone, and you always have to choose the country or jurisdiction code. Then you're going to put in the number. You can certainly add more information if you would like to, but I'm just going to add the phone number, and then I'm going to click Submit. Then your contact shows up on the emergency contact card, and it'll show that it's preferred. You can continue adding other contacts. Say you want to add just another contact, but they're not necessarily your preferred. They're not the primary one, and let's say this is a phone number, or I'm sorry, a phone number, and add whatever information you want to, and then submit, and then that person will come up as another contact, but Sherry will still be listed as your primary or preferred, and that's how you add an emergency contact.",
